  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. International Planned Parenthood Federation (IPPF) is the major global NGO working with sexual and reproductive health and rights. Their main focus is: Access (to SRHR), Abortion, AIDS/HIV, Adolescents and Advocacy. IPPF has member associations in 152 countries and has been supported by Sweden since its foundation in 1952.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1.IPPF &#xE4;r v&#xE4;rldens st&#xF6;rsta organisation som arbetar med sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xE4;lsa. Sverige har givit st&#xF6;d sedan dess start 1952. Huvudfokus &#xE4;r ( p&#xE5; engelska ben&#xE4;mnt de &quot;5A&quot;. Tillg&#xE5;ng till SRHR, Hiv/Aids, Aborter, ungdomar och p&#xE5;verkans arbete (f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad service, information f&#xF6;r alla)</narrative>
  </description>
